# Raycast's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-raycast-setting-cookie = 登录 https://www.raycast.com/settings，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies > https://www.raycast.com，将 __raycast_session（以及存在时的 csrf_token）复制为一条 "__raycast_session=value; csrf_token=value" 标头。

## The report: Raycast AI credits. Plan names (Pro, Pro+, Max) stay as
## Raycast names them.

usage-raycast-credits = 积分
usage-raycast-credits-left = 剩余积分
# Credits left, when there is no grant to measure them against.
usage-raycast-left = 剩余
usage-raycast-total = 总计
# When the credits renew; the value is a date.
usage-raycast-renews = 续订时间
